### 1. Bearer token
GET https://httpbin.org/bearer
X-Auth-Type: bearer
X-Auth-Token: my-secret-bearer-token

### 2. Basic auth
GET https://httpbin.org/basic-auth/alice/secret
X-Auth-Type: basic
X-Auth-User: alice
X-Auth-Pass: secret

### 3. OAuth2 (needs env vars set)
GET https://httpbin.org/get
X-Auth-Type: oauth2

### 4. No auth
GET https://httpbin.org/get